    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστοχ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐστοχ-ίη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skill in
				shooting at a mark, good aim</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τόξων εὐστοχίᾳ γάνυται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1239
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				217
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pancrat.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1085.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερὸς εὐ</span>., periphr. for
				<i>a bow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				812
			</span></i> (lyr.): in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.18
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.25
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. καὶροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.74d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>sagacity, shrewdness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1142b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.33.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρῶν εὐ</span>., of artists,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.310
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Damocharis</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. μνήμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			 H.</div>
